✔ every core field cue has a concise sound caption (1.672709ms)
✔ audio settings clamp channel volumes and expose caption state (0.163084ms)
✔ cue history and threat transitions stay observable without Web Audio (0.251792ms)
✔ cue history remains bounded during a long field session (0.124917ms)
✔ foundation exposes the locked viewport and performance budgets (1.582667ms)
✔ procedural placement is deterministic for a recorded seed (0.109334ms)
✔ representative scene contains all declared subject and pressure groups (0.098625ms)
✔ the family asset exposes two adults, three young and both authored behaviors (30.317292ms)
✔ the glade composition protects a lit family-and-basalt sightline (16.029709ms)
✔ frame percentile is stable and keeps the slow tail visible (0.508708ms)
✔ runtime sources contain no remote asset or CDN request (6.014208ms)
✔ presentation settings normalize invalid persisted values (1.642958ms)
✔ settings round-trip through versioned storage and can be reset (0.196458ms)
✔ blocked or malformed storage falls back without disabling controls (0.175875ms)
✔ the measured compact route starts with a 180-second light budget (0.979666ms)
✔ fresh and restarted player states are clean copies (0.85725ms)
✔ walking, sprinting and crouching have ordered deterministic speeds (0.538875ms)
✔ pause freezes both world time and movement (0.102958ms)
✔ a solid obstacle blocks penetration and permits axis sliding (1.54075ms)
✔ leaving the navigable world recovers the last stable position (0.139708ms)
✔ zone topology distinguishes the observation fork and both return routes (0.067583ms)
✔ territory, glade, open proof and cover produce four readable threat states (0.431ms)
✔ examining the brook makes context eligible without awarding evidence (0.133875ms)
✔ successive observed glade plates record young play and branch pull separately (0.237208ms)
✔ camera raise slows movement and shutter commits one physical plate for two live seconds (0.17825ms)
✔ open proof adds two awareness states and contact cracks the best intact plate (0.184833ms)
✔ a later contact without body margin fails while the first contact remains recoverable (0.067834ms)
✔ a timely raised-rifle shot spends one cartridge and interrupts attack (0.134833ms)
✔ pause freezes a raised camera and live shutter commitment without spending a plate (0.068709ms)
✔ restart clears observation, proof, damage and action history (0.078917ms)
✔ intact evidence and all four result thresholds are deterministic (0.088333ms)
✔ covered return commits its deterministic cost once and submits intact proof at Fort (0.168042ms)
✔ an attack-state exposed return cracks the best plate without spending body margin (0.110667ms)
✔ a fired-shot exposed return costs eighteen seconds and preserves its best plate (0.090125ms)
✔ remaining light expires outside Fort with exact cause and actionable cue (0.078916ms)
